### 3. Marquee/Ticker SCSS Utilities and Animations

**File:** `c:\Users\edn_y\renew_nineonelabs\resource\scss\components\_marquee.scss`

**Complete file (lines 1-90):**
```scss
@use "../abstract" as *;

.no-marquee {
  --marquee-duration: 20s;
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;

  &__viewport {
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
  }

  &__track {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--gutter-sm);
    width: fit-content;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  &__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--gutter-sm);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  &.is-marquee-fallback {
    .no-marquee__track {
      animation: no-marquee-slide var(--marquee-duration) linear infinite;
    }
  }
}

@keyframes no-marquee-slide {
  from {
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  }

  to {
    transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);
  }
}

.no-text-marquee {
  --text-marquee-duration: 28s;
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  pointer-events: none;

  &::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92) 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 18%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 50%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 82%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92) 100%
    );
  }

  &__track {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    width: max-content;
    min-width: 200%;
    gap: fluid(24, 40);
    animation: no-marquee-slide var(--text-marquee-duration) linear infinite;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  &__item {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(157, 187, 255, 0.14);
  }
}
```

**Usage in pages/_main.scss (lines 13-19):**
```scss
.no-marquee {
  height: 100vh;
  &__viewport {
    height: 100%;
    @include flex-center();
  }
}
```

---

